### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082/api/v1/orders
@orderId = 1

### 1. Create a New Order (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "totalAmount": 299.98
}

###

### 2. Fetch Order by ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json

